nd I added a security note to `CHANGELOG.md`.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on commit 597dec07c7.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\n**One thing to check:** even though the 3.x move is reportedly done, main still pinned fastjson 2.8.0. So this PR moves the service from 2.x to 3.x. CI passing is a good sign, but alex may want to look for 3.x behaviour changes that the tests don't cover.\n\nI didn't merge the PR. That needs a code owner's approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}